---
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ServiceCommitments from '../../components/ServiceCommitments.astro';
import { siteSchema, faqSchemas } from '../../data/structuredData';

import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<Layout
	title="Meta Ads - Creekside Marketing" 
  description="Scale your business with expert Meta Ads management. With $20M+ in ad spend managed, we combine high-quality creative with advanced Meta Pixel tracking to turn Facebook and Instagram into a growth engine."
  canonicalURL="https://creeksidemarketingpros.com/digital-advertising/meta-ads/"
  schema={siteSchema.metaAds}
  faqSchema={faqSchemas.metaAds}
>
	<Nav />
    <section class="bg-grey-50 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
        <header class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h1 class="text-primary-900 text-3xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight sm:text-4xl/tight lg:text-5xl/tight">
            Reach and engage your target audience with 
            <span class="text-secondary-500 block">Meta Ads</span>
          </h1>
          <div class="bg-secondary-500 h-1.5 w-20 rounded-full"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="text-grey-700 flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg/8">
          <p>
            At Creekside Marketing, we've successfully managed over <strong>$20 million in ad spend</strong>,
            helping businesses of all sizes harness the power of Facebook & Instagram Ads to achieve
            measurable growth.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our expertise with Meta Pixel and the Conversions API enables precise tracking and
            data-driven optimization, ensuring your ads reach the right audience at the right time.
            By crafting compelling ad content and employing advanced targeting strategies, we drive
            engagement, increase website traffic, and boost conversions.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-sm">
          <img 
            src="/facebook-ads.avif" 
            alt="Team engaging with Facebook Ads on mobile devices" 
            width="1642" 
            height="1100"
            loading="lazy"
            class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24" >
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 lg:px-8">

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-sm border-2 border-secondary-500 bg-white p-10 text-center shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
        <div class="mb-6 flex size-12 items-center justify-center text-primary-900">
			<img src="/date-range-svgrepo-com.svg" alt="A calendar icon">
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg/none font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-black">
          COMPREHENSIVE META ADS PERFORMANCE ANALYSIS
        </h3>
        <div class="my-6 h-0.5 w-48 bg-secondary-500"></div>
        <p class="text-base/6 font-medium text-grey-900">
        Our insights will guide strategic adjustments to enhance ad performance continually.
      </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-sm border-2 border-secondary-500 bg-white p-10 text-center shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
        <div class="mb-6 flex size-12 items-center justify-center text-primary-900">
          <img src="/bar-chart-02-svgrepo-com.svg" alt="A bar chart with ascending lines">
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg/none font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-black">
          END-TO-END META ADS CAMPAIGN MANAGEMENT
        </h3>
        <div class="my-6 h-0.5 w-48 bg-secondary-500"></div>
        <p class="text-base/6 font-medium text-grey-900">
        We focus on creating high-quality visuals and compelling ad copy that resonate with your target audience
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center rounded-sm border-2 border-secondary-500 bg-white p-10 text-center shadow-sm transition-shadow hover:shadow-md">
        <div class="mb-6 flex size-12 items-center justify-center text-primary-900">
          <img src="/spreadsheet-chart-svgrepo-com.svg" alt="Spreadsheet with line graph">
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg/none font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-black">
          ADVANCED CONVERSION TRACKING AND OPTIMIZATION
        </h3>
        <div class="my-6 h-0.5 w-48 bg-secondary-500"></div>
        <p class="text-base/6 font-medium text-grey-900">
        We implement Meta Pixel, Conversions API, and server-side tracking to measure every interaction stemming from your ads.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      
      <header>
        <h2 class="text-primary-900 text-4xl/tight font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-5xl/tight">
          Unlock the <span class="text-secondary-500">Full Potential</span> of Digital Marketing for Your Business
        </h2>
      </header>

      <div class="text-grey-700 flex flex-col gap-4 text-lg/8">
        <p>
          Meta Ads offer a wide range of opportunities to connect with your audience and
          achieve your business goals. From brand awareness to lead generation, we know the
          ins and outs of Meta's ad ecosystem. Our experts develop targeted ad campaigns,
          optimize your ad spend, and leverage advanced audience targeting to ensure maximum ROI.
        </p>
        <p>
          We implement Meta Pixel, Conversions API, and server-side first-party tracking on
          every account, then feed offline conversion data from your CRM back to Meta. Even
          with iOS privacy changes, Meta's algorithm learns from your real revenue, so it
          finds more of the customers who actually buy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="flex justify-center p-4">
        <img 
          src="/meta-ads-sales-target.avif" 
          alt="Illustration of digital marketing targeting" 
          width="1800" 
          height="1200"
          class="h-auto max-w-full"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="flex justify-center">
        <img 
          src="/meta-ads-tablet.avif" 
          alt="Analytics dashboard on a digital tablet" 
          width="1800" 
          height="1200"
          class="h-auto max-w-full rounded-sm shadow-sm"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
    <ServiceCommitments platform="Meta Ads" />
    <Footer />
</Layout>